==Battleground==
*2 [[Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Snache]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*1 [[Those Guys]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Manager Cat & Clerk Cat (Enemy)|Manager Cat & Clerk Cat]] spawns as the boss.
**6 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
**1 [[Snache]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**5 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

